1
00:01:43,102 --> 00:01:45,188
‎No! Stop!

2
00:01:45,271 --> 00:01:46,898
‎Don't do this, Talia!

3
00:01:46,981 --> 00:01:49,275
‎-Where's my fucking back-up?!
‎-Talia!

4
00:01:50,735 --> 00:01:54,781
‎What're you doing, Talia?!
‎That's your dad!

5
00:01:55,949 --> 00:01:58,618
‎Hmm. No camera today?

6
00:01:59,911 --> 00:02:01,079
‎Talia?

7
00:02:01,162 --> 00:02:04,624
‎And spare me. That isn't my dad.

8
00:02:04,707 --> 00:02:07,168
‎-Talia! Of course I'm your--
‎-Shut up!

9
00:02:10,505 --> 00:02:14,384
‎He killed my mom! He's not my dad.

10
00:02:18,596 --> 00:02:21,307
‎I promised I'd kill him.

11
00:02:36,865 --> 00:02:37,991
‎Talia!

12
00:02:38,074 --> 00:02:41,119
‎-Outta the way, kid!
‎-Target confirmed.

13
00:02:41,202 --> 00:02:44,164
‎Immobilize, do not kill!
‎Focus fire on her limbs!

14
00:02:53,882 --> 00:02:56,134
‎Now. Grab her while she's down--

15
00:03:06,853 --> 00:03:08,396
‎Go!

16
00:03:18,239 --> 00:03:20,408
‎Get me out of here! Hurry!

17
00:03:20,491 --> 00:03:21,868
‎Huh? But...

18
00:03:21,951 --> 00:03:23,912
‎She's after me!

19
00:03:31,586 --> 00:03:34,964
‎-‎1-0 to 1-4, report on status.
‎-‎Call for backup! Fall back!

20
00:03:35,048 --> 00:03:38,426
‎Don't stop! Keep going! Anywhere but here!

21
00:03:44,390 --> 00:03:45,391
‎Are you...

22
00:03:47,435 --> 00:03:48,436
‎Capri?

23
00:03:48,978 --> 00:03:50,063
‎D?

24
00:03:55,276 --> 00:03:57,320
‎He's alive?!

25
00:04:00,949 --> 00:04:02,533
‎Shut up!

26
00:04:07,121 --> 00:04:09,916
‎Shut up, shut up, shut up! Fuck!

27
00:04:18,758 --> 00:04:20,009
‎D! Get up!

28
00:04:38,528 --> 00:04:41,906
‎-Ow!
‎-The hell are you doing?!

29
00:04:41,990 --> 00:04:44,575
‎That hurt! Knock it off, Omi!

30
00:04:44,659 --> 00:04:48,246
‎Huh? Wha... Roman?

31
00:04:48,955 --> 00:04:50,999
‎What're you doing here?

32
00:04:56,838 --> 00:04:58,381
‎Ah, I remember now.

33
00:04:59,090 --> 00:05:00,425
‎That her? Your girlfriend?

34
00:05:01,134 --> 00:05:03,344
‎She's not my girlfriend.

35
00:05:03,428 --> 00:05:06,222
‎Mind tellin' me how
‎she wound up with Capri?

36
00:05:06,306 --> 00:05:07,890
‎-You didn't chip her again?
‎-I did that.

37
00:05:07,974 --> 00:05:09,892
‎-Like hell I did.
‎-‎It was me!

38
00:05:09,976 --> 00:05:12,395
‎Then how the heck does she have Capri?!

39
00:05:12,478 --> 00:05:13,604
‎I said I did it!

40
00:05:13,688 --> 00:05:16,024
‎-My stereo's glitchin'.
‎-Yeah, wait...

41
00:05:16,107 --> 00:05:17,275
‎Just shut the fuck up!

42
00:05:17,984 --> 00:05:21,362
‎I chipped 'er with Capri!
‎Glad you're not dead, by the way.

43
00:05:21,946 --> 00:05:23,614
‎Kang Tao fucked up in our favor.

44
00:05:24,532 --> 00:05:25,533
‎Kyoko?

45
00:05:26,951 --> 00:05:29,662
‎Roman. I figured you'd be there.

46
00:05:29,746 --> 00:05:31,372
‎Why'd you do it, Kyoko? Wha--

47
00:05:31,456 --> 00:05:33,791
‎You're that short broad from before.

48
00:05:34,500 --> 00:05:35,543
‎What're you after?

49
00:05:36,210 --> 00:05:38,880
‎That entirely depends. It still installed?

50
00:05:38,963 --> 00:05:41,174
‎-Don't follow.
‎-‎You will if you answer me.

51
00:05:42,216 --> 00:05:44,302
‎Is Capri still inside your head?
‎Yes or no?

52
00:05:45,178 --> 00:05:46,179
‎It matters.

53
00:05:48,097 --> 00:05:52,185
‎Yeah. A little. But only a little.

54
00:05:52,268 --> 00:05:55,563
‎What are you planning
‎to use Capricorn for?

55
00:05:55,646 --> 00:05:58,441
‎-Use?
‎-‎Yes. Once you get the shard--

56
00:05:58,524 --> 00:06:01,986
‎Not gonna. I just wanna see Capri again.

57
00:06:02,070 --> 00:06:03,321
‎What?

58
00:06:04,030 --> 00:06:05,448
‎I don't care what happens after.

59
00:06:10,161 --> 00:06:12,330
‎That's kind of impressive.

60
00:06:12,413 --> 00:06:14,832
‎I wish we'd met under
‎different circumstances.

61
00:06:16,834 --> 00:06:19,629
‎Fine. I'll help you.

62
00:06:19,712 --> 00:06:21,839
‎Not like any of us'll survive this anyway.

63
00:06:23,925 --> 00:06:25,676
‎You're pretty damn full of yourself.

64
00:06:26,427 --> 00:06:29,430
‎But I know I can't do this on my own.

65
00:06:29,514 --> 00:06:32,600
‎And here I thought you had no sense.

66
00:06:35,686 --> 00:06:37,939
‎What's got you gigglin'?

67
00:06:38,022 --> 00:06:39,982
‎Nothin'.

68
00:06:40,066 --> 00:06:42,860
‎But I can tell you're serious about this.

69
00:06:42,944 --> 00:06:44,237
‎What's that supposed to mean?

70
00:06:44,320 --> 00:06:45,321
‎Hey.

71
00:06:46,864 --> 00:06:47,865
‎Hey...

72
00:06:48,699 --> 00:06:50,243
‎Sorry. Seriously, sorry.

73
00:06:52,411 --> 00:06:55,039
‎So, D... You're not out for revenge anymore?

74
00:06:56,999 --> 00:06:58,126
‎No.

75
00:07:14,559 --> 00:07:18,479
‎Capture's no longer possible. I need evac.

76
00:07:18,563 --> 00:07:19,772
‎Please hurry--

77
00:07:20,815 --> 00:07:23,276
‎Damn it! Stop! Don't come any closer!

78
00:07:30,408 --> 00:07:32,785
‎Stop! Talia!

79
00:07:39,709 --> 00:07:40,793
‎Stop!

80
00:07:46,340 --> 00:07:47,800
‎You shouldn't have to do this.

81
00:07:50,261 --> 00:07:53,681
‎I'll finish him. This is for Avida.

82
00:07:57,018 --> 00:07:58,936
‎Shit! Why--

83
00:08:01,522 --> 00:08:03,441
‎Don't get in my way.

84
00:08:12,825 --> 00:08:14,452
‎Kill her!

85
00:08:14,535 --> 00:08:17,455
‎But our orders were to capture the target.

86
00:08:17,538 --> 00:08:19,248
‎Look at the size of it!

87
00:08:19,332 --> 00:08:20,458
‎This wasn't on the brief!

88
00:08:20,541 --> 00:08:22,210
‎Just kill her!

89
00:08:28,591 --> 00:08:29,592
‎Talia...

90
00:08:33,346 --> 00:08:34,347
‎Not yet...

91
00:08:35,806 --> 00:08:37,517
‎It's not too late.

92
00:08:41,896 --> 00:08:45,525
‎I promised I'd be here to bring you back.

93
00:08:46,859 --> 00:08:50,029
‎It's not over. You'll be okay.

94
00:09:02,416 --> 00:09:03,960
‎Talia.

95
00:09:43,165 --> 00:09:44,625
‎What the hell're you doing?

96
00:09:45,585 --> 00:09:47,837
‎Omi, take a right up here.

97
00:09:47,920 --> 00:09:49,046
‎You know where she is?

98
00:09:49,714 --> 00:09:51,048
‎Kinda.

99
00:09:52,633 --> 00:09:55,177
‎No... This is a mistake.

100
00:09:55,261 --> 00:09:57,972
‎Why me, Talia?

101
00:09:58,848 --> 00:10:01,767
‎Capture may no longer be a viable option.

102
00:10:01,851 --> 00:10:03,019
‎So I see.

103
00:10:03,102 --> 00:10:05,521
‎Eliminate it before
‎the other corporations notice.

104
00:10:06,230 --> 00:10:09,358
‎-We'll recover what we can afterwards.
‎-But how?

105
00:10:09,442 --> 00:10:11,527
‎The quickest way is an airstrike.

106
00:10:11,611 --> 00:10:13,070
‎In Night City?

107
00:10:17,908 --> 00:10:20,786
‎Copy that, sir.
‎We'll begin leading the target south.

108
00:10:21,871 --> 00:10:24,582
‎Shit. This is bad. An airstrike?!

109
00:10:24,665 --> 00:10:27,251
‎Hey, what's our current heading?

110
00:10:27,960 --> 00:10:30,004
‎South? The Badlands?

111
00:10:31,714 --> 00:10:33,090
‎They called an airstrike!

112
00:10:46,896 --> 00:10:48,064
‎Avida.

113
00:10:59,575 --> 00:11:00,868
‎Talia.

114
00:11:00,951 --> 00:11:03,496
‎Damn it...

115
00:11:40,616 --> 00:11:43,911
‎-Too late! He's already left!
‎-What?!

116
00:11:43,994 --> 00:11:46,414
‎Said he wasn't gonna
‎sit around and took off!

117
00:11:47,790 --> 00:11:51,544
‎Roman, listen to me!
‎Get D back before I get there!

118
00:11:51,627 --> 00:11:53,129
‎Hold on a sec!

119
00:11:53,212 --> 00:11:56,924
‎I'm bringing a CPRN-XW1.

120
00:11:57,007 --> 00:11:58,050
‎What's that?

121
00:11:58,134 --> 00:12:00,886
‎Think of it like a huge EMP.

122
00:12:00,970 --> 00:12:05,558
‎If I trigger it, every electronic device
‎within a 2 kilometer radius will go down.

123
00:12:05,641 --> 00:12:08,936
‎It should pierce Capri too.
‎This is what we'll use.

124
00:12:09,019 --> 00:12:12,898
‎While it's active, you all need
‎to stay away from her.

125
00:12:12,982 --> 00:12:15,860
‎Get through to D any way you can,

126
00:12:15,943 --> 00:12:17,695
‎then get outta there
‎before I arrive. Got it?

127
00:12:24,034 --> 00:12:27,788
‎Snap out of it, Capri.
‎You're still in there, aren't you?

128
00:12:38,674 --> 00:12:41,218
‎Dammit! Don't get in my way!

129
00:12:41,927 --> 00:12:43,762
‎What's happening over there?!

130
00:12:43,846 --> 00:12:45,764
‎How long does it take
‎to bring down one target?

131
00:12:45,848 --> 00:12:49,477
‎-We're paying for every second.
‎-All comm lines are down!

132
00:12:49,560 --> 00:12:51,604
‎I think Capricorn's disrupting the signal!

133
00:12:54,273 --> 00:12:57,359
‎Why, Talia? Why?

134
00:12:58,027 --> 00:12:59,987
‎You were always a good girl.

135
00:13:00,488 --> 00:13:04,533
‎You could've become something wonderful.

136
00:13:04,617 --> 00:13:06,494
‎And been my saving grace.

137
00:13:07,244 --> 00:13:08,245
‎Talia!

138
00:13:08,954 --> 00:13:10,998
‎That's my girl, Talia.

139
00:13:14,210 --> 00:13:15,878
‎My good girl.

140
00:13:15,961 --> 00:13:17,546
‎Shut up!

141
00:13:23,969 --> 00:13:24,970
‎What?

142
00:13:31,143 --> 00:13:33,187
‎It's no good. I can't get through!

143
00:13:33,270 --> 00:13:34,897
‎Can't we get any closer?

144
00:13:34,980 --> 00:13:37,107
‎No! Are you crazy?!

145
00:13:41,028 --> 00:13:43,072
‎-Kyoko!
‎-He's not here?!

146
00:13:43,155 --> 00:13:45,616
‎He can't reach us! Look at that thing!

147
00:13:46,408 --> 00:13:48,077
‎Tell me he's alive! Better be!

148
00:13:49,495 --> 00:13:51,163
‎How would I know?!

149
00:13:56,794 --> 00:14:00,130
‎This isn't like you, Capri.

150
00:14:05,302 --> 00:14:08,764
‎What do we do now?
‎There's no covering this up anymore.

151
00:14:08,847 --> 00:14:10,015
‎Clearly.

152
00:14:10,099 --> 00:14:13,102
‎Militech and Arasaka
‎will catch on any time now.

153
00:14:13,185 --> 00:14:14,603
‎Then we've no choice.

154
00:14:16,981 --> 00:14:18,232
‎Kyoko? What is it?

155
00:14:19,108 --> 00:14:22,361
‎The missiles have been launched.
‎Impact in 3 minutes.

156
00:14:24,905 --> 00:14:27,783
‎Shit. They actually did it.

157
00:14:27,867 --> 00:14:29,285
‎The bombs are on their way.

158
00:14:30,119 --> 00:14:32,872
‎Listen closely.
‎Hit the brakes when I give the signal.

159
00:14:32,955 --> 00:14:35,749
‎I'll activate this
‎at the last possible second!

160
00:14:35,833 --> 00:14:36,917
‎But...

161
00:14:37,001 --> 00:14:39,211
‎D is somewhere in that thing!

162
00:14:39,295 --> 00:14:42,965
‎Soon as it collapses,
‎come back and kick his ass awake!

163
00:14:43,048 --> 00:14:44,383
‎That's insane!

164
00:14:44,466 --> 00:14:46,969
‎It's the only option we've got!
‎Now, brake!

165
00:14:47,052 --> 00:14:49,179
‎What're you gonna do, Kyoko?!

166
00:14:54,810 --> 00:14:56,270
‎Shit.

167
00:14:56,353 --> 00:14:58,731
‎It's all or nothing now.

168
00:14:58,814 --> 00:15:01,442
‎This is definitely ‎not
‎how I saw this going.

169
00:16:26,402 --> 00:16:28,529
‎D. Wake up.

170
00:16:33,242 --> 00:16:34,910
‎Wake up!

171
00:16:36,036 --> 00:16:37,037
‎Roman?

172
00:16:42,126 --> 00:16:45,671
‎Look, Talia, you're standing.
‎That's my girl.

173
00:16:45,754 --> 00:16:47,089
‎I'm proud of you.

174
00:16:47,172 --> 00:16:50,676
‎Here. Let's try this one.
‎It's our company's product.

175
00:16:51,885 --> 00:16:54,763
‎I hope you know
‎I'm doing this for you.

176
00:16:55,681 --> 00:16:56,765
‎It's all for you.

177
00:16:59,560 --> 00:17:01,895
‎This isn't like you, Capri.

178
00:17:03,897 --> 00:17:05,149
‎You're acting like me.

179
00:17:06,817 --> 00:17:08,444
‎Who the hell are you?

180
00:17:09,653 --> 00:17:10,946
‎I'm not here for you.

181
00:17:11,030 --> 00:17:14,575
‎Answer the damn question!

182
00:17:16,493 --> 00:17:18,412
‎Fair enough!

183
00:17:26,962 --> 00:17:28,839
‎Well, that ain't fair.

184
00:17:33,886 --> 00:17:35,095
‎Hey, take it easy.

185
00:17:44,897 --> 00:17:45,898
‎You know...

186
00:17:46,523 --> 00:17:49,151
‎I came all the way to get you, Capri.

187
00:17:57,493 --> 00:17:58,577
‎D!

188
00:17:59,953 --> 00:18:02,331
‎Hey. Hey. Capri.

189
00:18:03,665 --> 00:18:05,084
‎Come on, Capri!

190
00:18:05,584 --> 00:18:06,585
‎Whoa!

191
00:18:10,839 --> 00:18:12,591
‎Get a grip.

192
00:18:13,300 --> 00:18:15,302
‎Got swallowed up by all her feelings.

193
00:18:17,387 --> 00:18:19,431
‎Oh, it's you.

194
00:18:19,515 --> 00:18:21,850
‎-Been a minute.
‎-Been a while.

195
00:18:27,231 --> 00:18:30,275
‎What's up? Oh. Is it your turn again?

196
00:18:30,359 --> 00:18:31,360
‎This time...

197
00:18:32,027 --> 00:18:33,612
‎This time's gonna be different.

198
00:18:34,780 --> 00:18:36,824
‎Let's have some fun. Just you and me.

199
00:18:38,200 --> 00:18:39,493
‎Capri.

200
00:18:46,333 --> 00:18:47,334
‎D!

201
00:18:48,335 --> 00:18:49,753
‎Hey, Roman.

202
00:18:51,004 --> 00:18:52,005
‎Here. Take her.

203
00:18:52,089 --> 00:18:53,173
‎Talia!

204
00:18:54,758 --> 00:18:56,593
‎You good, choom?

205
00:18:56,677 --> 00:18:58,095
‎Yeah, I got her...

206
00:19:00,597 --> 00:19:01,890
‎Oof...

207
00:19:05,602 --> 00:19:07,521
‎Ow! Wha--

208
00:19:07,604 --> 00:19:09,022
‎The hell is this?

209
00:19:09,106 --> 00:19:11,692
‎You were falling apart,
‎so I patched you back up!

210
00:19:11,775 --> 00:19:13,277
‎A little reinforcement.

211
00:19:13,944 --> 00:19:16,280
‎-Looks stupid.
‎-Didn't have much to work with.

212
00:19:16,363 --> 00:19:18,782
‎Feel like you didn't try very hard.

213
00:19:18,866 --> 00:19:20,993
‎This her arm? Can I use it?

214
00:19:39,761 --> 00:19:41,889
‎You need to keep moving.

215
00:19:42,639 --> 00:19:45,601
‎The corpos'll be back again.

216
00:19:47,769 --> 00:19:49,271
‎You're still hanging on?

217
00:19:50,022 --> 00:19:52,733
‎The next wave won't
‎be bargain-bin security.

218
00:19:53,567 --> 00:19:57,654
‎Arasaka and Militech will be
‎joining the scramble for you...

219
00:19:58,780 --> 00:19:59,990
‎Cool.

220
00:20:01,074 --> 00:20:02,075
‎Wanna watch?

221
00:20:08,707 --> 00:20:09,958
‎She dead?

222
00:20:11,084 --> 00:20:12,085
‎Can't tell.

223
00:20:18,383 --> 00:20:21,136
‎Hey, D! Did you find Capri?

224
00:20:22,179 --> 00:20:23,222
‎Yeah.

225
00:20:25,474 --> 00:20:28,477
‎So this is it... the climax of your story.

226
00:20:29,144 --> 00:20:30,229
‎Isn't it?

227
00:20:32,064 --> 00:20:33,232
‎I'm comin' with you.

228
00:20:34,191 --> 00:20:36,443
‎Can't miss this! It's your--

229
00:20:36,526 --> 00:20:38,028
‎Forget it, Roman.

230
00:20:38,111 --> 00:20:40,113
‎If I don't film it, who will?

231
00:20:40,906 --> 00:20:44,201
‎I'll scroll it for you. Watched
‎you enough times. I know the drill.

232
00:20:45,369 --> 00:20:47,246
‎Like this, right?

233
00:20:52,834 --> 00:20:53,877
‎You can't.

234
00:21:05,681 --> 00:21:08,642
‎You're planning to die, aren't you?
‎That's it, isn't it?!

235
00:21:09,643 --> 00:21:12,354
‎Roman. You and that camera
‎are gonna get other chances.

236
00:21:13,188 --> 00:21:14,523
‎That's not fair.

237
00:21:15,315 --> 00:21:18,193
‎This is the high point
‎of my story. Not yours.

238
00:21:18,902 --> 00:21:20,070
‎That's not fair!

239
00:21:21,029 --> 00:21:22,990
‎You still have a lot ahead of you.

240
00:21:25,492 --> 00:21:27,494
‎That's not fair! I...

241
00:21:27,577 --> 00:21:28,620
‎Roman.

242
00:21:33,750 --> 00:21:35,127
‎I'm sorry.

243
00:21:45,762 --> 00:21:48,265
‎Take care of Roman. And her, too.

244
00:21:50,892 --> 00:21:51,893
‎You headin' out?

245
00:21:52,728 --> 00:21:53,729
‎Yeah.

246
00:21:55,272 --> 00:21:56,273
‎David.

247
00:21:57,482 --> 00:21:58,525
‎Know what?

248
00:21:59,234 --> 00:22:00,861
‎You're an idiot.

249
00:22:09,161 --> 00:22:10,162
‎Hey, Capri?

250
00:22:12,247 --> 00:22:15,500
‎A while back, there was this guy
‎with the same name as me.

251
00:22:16,168 --> 00:22:17,252
‎Huh.

252
00:22:17,336 --> 00:22:18,754
‎Had his own people.

253
00:22:19,671 --> 00:22:22,632
‎Chose to die for them in the end.

254
00:22:23,800 --> 00:22:25,594
‎Least... that's what it looked like to me.

255
00:22:27,179 --> 00:22:28,805
‎Not sure I could do that.

256
00:22:30,015 --> 00:22:33,143
‎What do you think was
‎goin' through his mind?

257
00:22:34,311 --> 00:22:35,353
‎Beats me.

258
00:22:35,979 --> 00:22:36,980
‎Why?

259
00:22:37,939 --> 00:22:40,150
‎Any reason you bring that up now?

260
00:22:41,193 --> 00:22:44,571
‎Dunno. Talking with Omi
‎made me think of him.

261
00:22:45,322 --> 00:22:46,615
‎Here they come.

262
00:22:57,584 --> 00:23:00,504
‎Alright, Capri. Let's have some fun.

263
00:23:13,600 --> 00:23:14,976
‎That it?

264
00:23:15,936 --> 00:23:18,355
‎Over already?

265
00:23:29,241 --> 00:23:31,535
‎Look up there! Think we can make it?

266
00:23:35,622 --> 00:23:36,623
‎Sure we can.

267
00:23:38,792 --> 00:23:40,627
‎Take care, Roman!

268
00:23:42,045 --> 00:23:44,131
‎That's where the reel ends.

269
00:23:47,008 --> 00:23:48,343
‎D was an idiot.

270
00:23:50,846 --> 00:23:54,766
‎The cause of the widespread
‎blackout remains unknown.

271
00:23:54,850 --> 00:23:57,561
‎Eyewitness accounts describe seeing

272
00:23:57,644 --> 00:24:00,522
‎a strange mass of machinery
‎moments prior to the explosion,

273
00:24:00,605 --> 00:24:03,275
‎but all the footage of the incident
‎has seemingly been corrupted.

274
00:24:04,151 --> 00:24:05,986
‎What do you think happened to D?

275
00:24:06,069 --> 00:24:07,654
‎There's no way he survived.

276
00:24:08,780 --> 00:24:11,533
‎That's just the kinda guy he was.

277
00:24:12,159 --> 00:24:13,910
‎What? You're filming?

278
00:24:13,994 --> 00:24:18,456
‎Yeah. The fact that we got Talia
‎outta there... it was a miracle.

279
00:24:19,666 --> 00:24:21,418
‎Avida was watchin' over us.

280
00:24:22,002 --> 00:24:23,003
‎I'm sure of it.

281
00:24:23,503 --> 00:24:26,131
‎Oh, shit. Oh, shit!

282
00:24:26,214 --> 00:24:27,382
‎Miguel!

283
00:24:27,465 --> 00:24:28,466
‎You know him?

284
00:24:30,677 --> 00:24:33,263
‎Just an old choom.

285
00:24:33,346 --> 00:24:36,308
‎I'm afraid it seems
‎her recovery was only temporary.

286
00:24:36,391 --> 00:24:37,726
‎There's nothin' you can do?

287
00:24:37,809 --> 00:24:39,811
‎First, we need to remove her implants...

288
00:24:40,437 --> 00:24:41,646
‎It's a nice place, right?

289
00:24:42,480 --> 00:24:44,941
‎That's what Weak says.

290
00:24:45,025 --> 00:24:46,526
‎But I've never been.

291
00:24:48,236 --> 00:24:49,237
‎What?

292
00:24:51,865 --> 00:24:54,576
‎Why the long face? Gonna miss me?

293
00:24:55,243 --> 00:24:57,454
‎-Need a hand?
‎-I'm fine.

294
00:24:58,413 --> 00:25:00,332
‎Take care, Roman.

295
00:25:00,415 --> 00:25:01,958
‎You too, Talia.

296
00:25:04,336 --> 00:25:05,962
‎Ping me when you get there!

297
00:25:06,046 --> 00:25:08,423
‎I'll come visit! And scroll you again.

298
00:25:09,090 --> 00:25:11,718
‎Yeah... Looking forward to it.

299
00:25:18,892 --> 00:25:20,977
‎I'm off, then.

300
00:25:21,061 --> 00:25:22,771
‎You sure?

301
00:25:24,272 --> 00:25:26,233
‎I'll see him again.

302
00:25:27,984 --> 00:25:30,195
‎Wait! Talia.

303
00:25:30,820 --> 00:25:35,033
‎I don't want you to go!
‎You can't leave! Just--

304
00:25:36,117 --> 00:25:37,160
‎Please don't go!

305
00:25:38,245 --> 00:25:41,164
‎I want you to stay! Please!

306
00:25:41,248 --> 00:25:42,540
‎Talia!

307
00:25:45,460 --> 00:25:46,461
‎Roman.

308
00:25:47,087 --> 00:25:49,422
‎We'll see each other again.

309
00:25:50,966 --> 00:25:52,050
‎Okay.

310
00:25:52,133 --> 00:25:56,054
‎Until then, you just keep
‎that camera rollin', huh?

311
00:25:57,055 --> 00:25:58,056
‎Okay.

312
00:25:58,139 --> 00:26:00,809
‎Then you can come show me what you made.

313
00:26:01,643 --> 00:26:06,064
‎Scroll somethin' so great
‎it'll make all this crap feel small.

314
00:26:06,147 --> 00:26:09,025
‎-D'you think I can?
‎-I know you can.

315
00:26:09,818 --> 00:26:12,404
‎You scrolled me lookin'
‎perfect back then, didn't you?

316
00:26:13,238 --> 00:26:14,489
‎It'll be a piece of cake.

317
00:26:17,534 --> 00:26:20,245
‎You were perfect, Talia.

318
00:26:20,829 --> 00:26:21,997
‎You always have been.

319
00:26:23,039 --> 00:26:24,582
‎Whoa, what a line.

320
00:26:30,297 --> 00:26:31,631
‎Don't you start.

321
00:26:32,340 --> 00:26:34,342
‎I'm still alive, aren't I?

322
00:26:35,552 --> 00:26:36,553
‎My bad.

323
00:26:38,430 --> 00:26:39,431
‎You're damn right.

324
00:26:40,348 --> 00:26:42,017
‎We're gonna live, Talia!

325
00:28:21,908 --> 00:28:26,913
‎Subtitle translation by:
‎CD PROJEKT RED & Megumi Hunter
